The Prime Minister, Shri Narendra Modi,  today, shared an article by Union Minister Shri Pralhad  Joshi and Mr Mike Bloomberg on how India's clean energy transition is gathering pace, with solar power playing a growing role in meeting the country's energy needs. Shri Modi remarked that the  article highlights the growth of renewable energy, the expansion of rooftop solar and investments in storage and transmission. And how this shift is helping reduce electricity bills, create jobs and strengthen energy security. Shri Modi posted on X; India's clean energy transition is gathering pace, with solar power playing a growing role in meeting the country's energy needs. @MikeBloomberg and Union Minister Shri @JoshiPralhad write about the growth of renewable energy, the expansion of rooftop solar and investments in storage and transmission. They highlight how this shift is helping reduce electricity bills, create jobs and strengthen energy security. India's clean energy transition is gathering pace, with solar power playing a growing role in meeting the country's energy needs.

